ep `completed`, `remaining`, and `risks` as free-form narrative context only. They inform operators, but they do not override the structured verdict or control scheduler state.\n- Completed or blocked JSON describing test coverage, validation status, and follow-up needs.\n- Precise defect or coverage notes when the bead cannot be completed within tester scope.",
